<p>Vue (pronounced /vjuː/, like view) is a progressive framework for building user interfaces. It is designed to be incrementally adoptable, with the ability to scale between just a library and a full-feature framework, depending on your use case.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="section-our-team" data-cy="section-our-team" class="sc-3340244f-0 eGKBUl"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 sc-7355880b-0 jyulmr"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 uzGKt"><h2 font-weight="500" color="black.700" class="sc-dcb94ee2-0 sc-dcb94ee2-5 kmgLsS">Our team</h2><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 bGxwtX"><div width="144" height="auto" class="sc-2c35d607-0 sc-d82cae7-0 bfQJEs gMcYKv"><div class="sc-d82cae7-1 jfGyLV"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 inLDtj"><a href="/posva"><div style="background-image:url(https://images.opencollective.com/posva/36aa613/avatar.png);background-size:cover" size="64" type="USER" src="https://images.opencollective.com/posva/36aa613/avatar.png" title="Eduardo San Martin Morote" class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 kFsjOb cskNqH sc-ff045f41-0 iEGXco"></div></a></div></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 iJlvnw hqNDzM"><a href="/posva"><p color="black.900" font-weight="500" title="Eduardo San Martin Morote" class="sc-dcb94ee2-0 boFGUd">Eduardo San M...</p></a><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 gmTaiH"><div class="sc-afa001f2-0 fZtaHx sc-d82cae7-4 kJsbDm">Core Contributor</div></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 eVvpCT"></div></div></div><div width="144" height="auto" class="sc-2c35d607-0 sc-d82cae7-0 bfQJEs gMcYKv"><div class="sc-d82cae7-1 jfGyLV"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 inLDtj"><a href="/znck"><div style="background-image:url(https://images.opencollective.com/znck/1632019/avatar.png);background-size:cover" size="64" type="USER" src="https://images.opencollective.com/znck/1632019/avatar.png" title="Rahul Kadyan" class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 kFsjOb cskNqH sc-ff045f41-0 iEGXco"></div></a></div></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 iJlvnw hqNDzM"><a href="/znck"><p color="blac